<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<GameData>
  <LocalizedText>
    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_DESTINATION_HELP" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>确认派遣并到达目的地后，[NEWLINE]选择任务，在简报中开启循环。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_DESTINATION_HELP" Language="en_US"><Text>After arrival, choose a mission.[NEWLINE]Enable repeat in its briefing.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_MISSION_LIST_HELP" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>选择下方任务，在任务简报中[NEWLINE]勾选「自动重复此任务」。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_MISSION_LIST_HELP" Language="en_US"><Text>Choose a mission below.[NEWLINE]Enable repeat in its briefing.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_AUTO_SHORT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>自动</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_AUTO_SHORT" Language="en_US"><Text>AUTO</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_TITLE" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>间谍循环</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_TITLE" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Spy Repeat</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_HELP" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>在任务确认时勾选循环，或打开单位面板管理。关闭仅停止续派；暂停后需手动恢复。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_HELP" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Choose repeat when assigning a mission, or manage it from the unit panel. Turning it off preserves the current mission. Resume pauses manually.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_ENABLE" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>开启自动重复</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_ENABLE" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Enable repeat</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_DISABLE" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>关闭自动重复</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_DISABLE" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Disable repeat</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_RESUME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
