    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_DETAIL_HELP" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>仅影响后续续派，不会打断当前任务。晋升、逃跑和调动时暂停。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_DETAIL_HELP" Language="en_US">
