    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_ESCAPE_HELP" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>请点击游戏的间谍任务通知处理逃跑；处理后手动恢复循环。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_SR_ESCAPE_HELP" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Use the game mission notification to resolve the escape, then resume repeat manually.</Text>
    </Row>
